OL,3,GNEWSACourt of Appeal to hear residents'
OL,4,Aparade challenge over Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FA challenge to the decision to allow a
OL,7,Fcontroversial Orange Order parade to go
OL,8,Fdown a predominantly nationalist road
OL,9,Fis due to be heard in court later.
OL,11,FThe deadlock over the proposed march in
OL,12,FPortadown - opposed by residents of the
OL,13,FGarvaghy Road - has lasted since last
OL,14,FSunday morning.
OL,16,FThe stalemate has reopened what was
OL,17,Fonce the most bitter parading dispute
OL,18,Fin Northern Ireland, with stand-offs in
OL,19,Fthe mid-to-late 90s accompanied by
OL,20,Friots, roadblocks and killings.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
