OL,3,GNEWSACourt of Appeal to hear residents'
OL,4,Aparade challenge over Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fresh Court of Appeal application
OL,7,Fargues that the Parades Commission, the
OL,8,Forganisation that approved the march,
OL,9,Fhad "materially misdirected itself" on
OL,10,Fthe police assessment of the potential
OL,11,Ffor disorder.
